port: cookie login + account screen (Phase 4 — cookie login)

Desktop WebView2 login flow mirroring `ui/screens/LoginScreen.kt`:

- `pubspec.yaml`: `webview_flutter_windows ^1.3.1` (WebView2 via WebviewController API).
- `lib/services/cookie_store.dart` (new): Hive boxes `COOKIES` + `ACCOUNT`;
  `CookieStore.captureFromWebView(WebviewController)` reads cookies via
  `WebviewController.getCookies('https://music.youtube.com/')`;
  `CookieStore.buildCookieHeader(Map)`.
- `lib/ytmusic/client.dart`: `YTClient.sendRequest` / `sendGetRequest` now merge
  the `Cookie` header from `CookieStore` (Android InnerTube sends cookies on
  every request; desktop previously sent none).
- `lib/ytmusic/client.dart`: `YTClient.getAccountInfo()` — port of
  `YouTube.accountInfo()`: `account/account_menu` →
  `actions[0].openPopupAction.popup.multiPageMenuRenderer.header
  .activeAccountHeaderRenderer` → `{name, email, channelHandle, avatarUrl}`.
- `lib/screens/login/login_page.dart` (new): opens WebView2 to
  `https://music.youtube.com/login`, listens to `WebviewController.url`;
  on a google/youtube host: `captureFromWebView` → `getAccountInfo()` →
  `CookieStore.saveAccount` → `context.go('/')`.
- `lib/screens/account/account_page.dart` (new): shows the account (avatar,
  name, email, channel handle), "Sign out" (clears cookies + account),
  "Sign in" (→ `/login`), "Close".
- `lib/utils/router.dart`: new branches `/login` (LoginPage) and `/account`
  (AccountPage).
- `lib/main.dart`: opens Hive boxes `COOKIES` + `ACCOUNT`.
- Tests: `test/cookie_store_test.dart` (2 cases).

Verified: `flutter analyze` 0 errors, `flutter test` 20/20,
`flutter build windows --debug` → `echo.exe`, 14 s smoke run clean.
